          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Engelbart, D. C. (1962). *Augmenting Human Intellect: A Conceptual Framework*."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-317",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Matuschak, A. [*Evergreen Notes*](https://notes.andymatuschak.org/)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-318",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
